":"குக்","tr":"kuk"}]},{"text":"கடனே","tr":"kaṭaṉē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கட","tr":"kaṭa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"ஆட்சியாளர்","parts":[{"text":"ஆட்சி","lemma":"ஆட்சி","gloss":"rule"},{"text":"ஆளர்","lemma":"ஆளர்","gloss":"rulers"}],"gloss":"rulers"},{"surface":"நெஞ்சங்களில்","parts":[{"text":"நெஞ்சம்","lemma":"நெஞ்சம்","gloss":"heart"},{"text":"கள்","lemma":"கள்","gloss":"plural suffix"},{"text":"இல்","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"in"}],"gloss":"in the hearts"},{"surface":"ஆழ","parts":[{"text":"ஆழ","lemma":"ஆழ","gloss":"deeply"}],"gloss":"deeply"},{"surface":"பதியவேண்டிய","parts":[{"text":"பதிய","lemma":"பதி","gloss":"to imprint"},{"text":"வேண்டிய","lemma":"வேண்டு","gloss":"necessary"}],"gloss":"which must be imprinted"},{"surface":"ஒரு","parts":[{"text":"ஒரு","lemma":"ஒரு","gloss":"one"}],"gloss":"one"},{"surface":"செய்யுளும்","parts":[{"text":"செய்யுள்","lemma":"செய்யுள்","gloss":"poem"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"poem also"},{"surface":"ஆம்","parts":[{"text":"ஆம்","lemma":"ஆம்","gloss":"is"}],"gloss":"is"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நெல்லும்","parts":[{"text":"நெல்","lemma":"நெல்","gloss":"rice"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"rice also"},{"surface":"உயிர்","parts":[{"text":"உயிர்","lemma":"உயிர்","gloss":"life"}],"gloss":"life"},{"surface":"அன்றே","parts":[{"text":"அன்று","lemma":"அன்று","gloss":"is not"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"is indeed not"},{"surface":"நீரும்","parts":[{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"நீர்","gloss":"water"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"water also"},{"surface":"உயிர்","parts":[{"text":"உயிர்","lemma":"உயிர்","gloss":"life"}],"gloss":"life"},{"surface":"அன்றே","parts":[{"text":"அன்று","lemma":"அன்று","gloss":"is not"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"is indeed not"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மன்னன்","parts":[{"text":"மன்னன்","lemma":"மன்னன்","gloss":"king"}],"gloss":"king"},{"surface":"உயிர்த்தே","parts":[{"text":"உயிர்","lemma":"உயிர்","gloss":"life"},{"text":"து","lemma":"து","gloss":"it/is"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"is indeed the life"},{"surface":"மலர்தலை","parts":[{"text":"மலர்","lemma":"மலர்","gloss":"to expand"},{"text":"தலை","lemma":"தலை","gloss":"place"}],"gloss":"wide-spread"},{"surface":"உலகம்","parts":[{"text":"உலகம்","lemma":"உலகம்","gloss":"world"}],"gloss":"world"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அதனால்","parts":[{"text":"அது","lemma":"அது","gloss":"that"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"அன்","gloss":"increment"},{"text":"ஆல்","lemma":"ஆல்","gloss":"by/therefore"}],"gloss":"therefore"},{"surface":"யான்உயிர்","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"யான்","gloss":"I"},{"text":"உயிர்","lemma":"உயிர்","gloss":"life"}],"gloss":"I am the life"},{"surface":"என்பது","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"to say"},{"text":"பது","lemma":"பது","gloss":"that which is"}],"gloss":"that which is said"},{"surface":"அறிகை","parts":[{"text":"அறி","lemma":"அறி","gloss":"to know"},{"text":"கை","lemma":"கை","gloss":"should"}],"gloss":"should know"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வேன்மிகு","parts":[{"text":"வேன்மிகு","lemma":"வேன்மிகு","gloss":"spear-abundant"}],"gloss":"spear-abundant","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தானை","parts":[{"text":"தானை","lemma":"தானை","gloss":"army"}],"gloss":"army"},{"surface":"வேந்தற்கு","parts":[{"text":"வேந்தன்","lemma":"வேந்தன்","gloss":"king"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"to"}],"gloss":"to the king"},{"surface":"கடனே","parts":[{"text":"கடன்","lemma":"கடன்","gloss":"duty"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"is indeed the duty"}]}],"literal":"Rulers' hearts in, deeply to be imprinted, one poem also is / Rice also life is indeed not, water also life is indeed not / King is indeed the life of the wide-spread world / Therefore, 'I am the life' saying that should know / Spear-abundant army king's duty indeed.","translation":"This is also a poem that must be deeply imprinted in the hearts of rulers: Rice is not the life, nor is water the life. The king is indeed the life of this wide, sprawling world! Therefore, to know that 'I am the life' is the duty of the king who leads an army abundant with spears.","modern":"ஆட்சியாளர்களின் நெஞ்சங்களில் ஆழமாகப் பதியவேண்டிய ஒரு செய்யுளும் இதுவாகும்: நெல்லும் உயிர் அல்ல, நீரும் உயிர் அல்ல. பரந்த இடத்தைக் கொண்ட இவ்வுலகத்திற்கு மன்னனே உயிராவான். அதனால், 'நானே இவ்வுலகிற்கு உயிர்' என்பதை உணர்ந்து கொள்வது, வேல்கள் மிகுந்த படையைக் கொண்ட வேந்தனின் கடமையாகும்.","explanation":"This poem is a famous piece of advice from the poet Mōcikīraṉār, classified under the theme of Poruṇmoḻik Kāñci in the Potuviyal tiṇai. The poet addresses the ruler, emphasizing that the true sustenance of a nation does not lie merely in material resources like grain or water, but in the righteous governance of the king. The wide-spread world depends entirely on the ruler for its life and order. Therefore, it is the ultimate duty of a king who commands a mighty army of spears to realize that he is the very soul and life of his people. This realization guides him to rule with deep responsibility and compassion.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.9],[0.9,1.4],[1.4,1.8],[1.8,2.3],[2.3,2.5],[2.5,3.0],[3.0,3.2],[3.2,4.2],[4.2,4.5],[4.5,4.75],[4.75,5.0],[5.0,5.4],[5.4,5.6],[5.6,6.8],[6.8,7.2],[7.2,7.4],[7.4,7.9],[7.9,8.8],[8.8,9.2],[9.2,9.5],[9.5,9.9],[9.9,10.7],[10.7,11.1],[11.1,11.6],[11.6,12.1]],"female":[[0.0,0.9],[0.9,1.5],[1.5,2.0],[2.0,2.7],[2.7,2.9],[2.9,3.4],[3.4,3.8],[3.8,4.7],[4.7,5.0],[5.0,5.3],[5.3,5.6],[5.6,6.0],[6.0,6.3],[6.3,7.8],[7.8,8.1],[8.1,8.3],[8.3,8.9],[8.9,10.0],[10.0,10.5],[10.5,10.8],[10.8,11.2],[11.2,12.8],[12.8,12.98],[12.98,13.53],[13.53,13.8]]},"sync":[[["ஆட்சியாளர்","rulers"]],[["நெஞ்சங்களில்","in the hearts"]],[["ஆழ","deeply"]],[["பதியவேண்டிய","which must be imprinted"]],[["ஒரு","one"]],[["செய்யுளும்","poem also"]],[["ஆம்","is"]],[["நெல்லும்","rice also"]],[["உயிர்","life"]],[["அன்றே","is indeed not"]],[["நீரும்","water also"]],[["உயிர்","life"]],[["அன்றே","is indeed not"]],[["மன்னன்","king"]],[["உயிர்த்தே","is indeed the life"]],[["மலர்தலை","wide-spread"]],[["உலகம்","world"]],[["அதனால்","therefore"]],[["யான்உயிர்","I am the life"]],[["என்பது","that which is said"]],[["அறிகை","should know"]],[["வேன்மிகு","spear-abundant"]],[["தானை","army"]],[["வேந்தற்கு","to the king"],["கடனே","is indeed the duty"]],[["கடனே","is indeed the duty"]]]}